  message: "Cross-item review 2026-05-17: formalized blockers as isbefore — INV-mofav (nested-fn drops) and WI-vuton (polymorphic dispatch FPs) are now declared predecessors. Per this item's own description, the 113 orphan functions + 13 orphan classes need those two upstream root causes to ship first so the triage can isolate genuinely dead code (bucket c) from analyzer/dispatch artifacts (a/b)."  # a29a
